temp/*
# types/ is the installed-type directory of the default instance - the one
# `run-server.bat` starts with no -c. Nothing here runs that instance: LimeOS
# points TYPES-LOCATION at VDOM-SERVER-RUN/types, so this copy drifted, and 86
# of its 89 types no longer match what serves. Versioning it put a decoy in the
# tree that looked like "the types" and was not. `repository/types/*.xml` is
# the versioned form of a type; this is a build output of `manage deploy`.
/types/
fonts/*
sources/*.xml
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode
claude-run.bat

# PLY writes these next to the grammar when the lexer or parser changes.
parser.out
parsetab.py
